  ('being-a-good-neighbor', 1, 'Walk to the end of your street or hallway and back, and simply notice which homes look lived in and who is out and about.'),
  ('being-a-good-neighbor', 2, 'Wave to the first neighbor you see today, even if you have never spoken before.'),
  ('being-a-good-neighbor', 3, 'Learn one neighbor''s first name today, and write it down somewhere you will see it again.'),
  ('being-a-good-neighbor', 4, 'Say good morning to anyone you pass between your door and the sidewalk.'),
  ('being-a-good-neighbor', 5, 'Spend ten minutes on your front step or balcony today, visible and unhurried, so neighbors can see a friendly face.'),
  ('being-a-good-neighbor', 6, 'Greet a neighbor by name today, using the name you learned recently.'),
  ('being-a-good-neighbor', 7, 'Introduce yourself to one neighbor you have seen often but never met: "Hi, I''m in number 12, I don''t think we''ve properly met."'),
  ('being-a-good-neighbor', 8, 'When you take out your own trash, bring a neighbor''s empty can back up from the curb to their door.'),
  ('being-a-good-neighbor', 9, 'Hold the building or lobby door for someone who lives near you, and add a quick "have a good one."'),
  ('being-a-good-neighbor', 10, 'Notice a package sitting on a neighbor''s step in the rain and move it somewhere dry and out of sight.'),
  ('being-a-good-neighbor', 11, 'Ask a neighbor a simple, easy question today, like how long they have lived on the street.'),
  ('being-a-good-neighbor', 12, 'Pay one neighbor a sincere compliment on something you can see, such as their flowers, their porch light or their dog.'),
  ('being-a-good-neighbor', 13, 'Sketch a simple map of the homes or doors nearest yours and fill in any names you know.'),
  ('being-a-good-neighbor', 14, 'Pick up one piece of litter on your block that is not yours and throw it away.'),
  ('being-a-good-neighbor', 15, 'Spend a little money at a small shop within walking distance of your home this week, and chat briefly with whoever rings you up.'),
  ('being-a-good-neighbor', 16, 'Say hello to the mail carrier or delivery driver who serves your street, and thank them for their work.'),
  ('being-a-good-neighbor', 17, 'Check whether your music, TV or footsteps carry through walls or windows late in the evening, and turn things down a notch if so.'),
  ('being-a-good-neighbor', 18, 'Look at how you parked today and make sure you are not blocking a driveway, a mailbox or someone''s usual spot.'),
  ('being-a-good-neighbor', 19, 'Bake or buy a small treat and leave it with a neighbor you have been meaning to meet, along with a note giving your first name.'),
  ('being-a-good-neighbor', 20, 'Find out when the next community event in your town is, and put it on your calendar.'),
  ('being-a-good-neighbor', 21, 'Offer to sign for or hold a delivery for a neighbor who will be away.'),
